Upstream: Qt
------------
ferrokit re-implements parts of the design, the algorithms and the observable behaviour of Qt
(https://github.com/qt/qtbase, checked against qtbase 6.11.x). Comments in the source point at the
qtbase files and lines that a behaviour was checked against. Qt is available under several
licenses, among them the LGPL-3.0-only that ferrokit uses.

The qtbase files referred to carry the copyright of The Qt Company Ltd. and, in some files, of
other contributors, among them Intel Corporation, Klaralvdalens Datakonsult AB (a KDAB Group
company), Olivier Goffart, Samuel Gaist and Konstantin Ritt. The header of each upstream file has
its exact notices. This list is not exhaustive.

